"Devin survives a group tutorial of eleven people in a desert ringed by mountains."
"His first class specializes in burning attacks and grants him deep resistance to heat."
"His axe shifts between a two-handed axe and a hand axe with a shield at a button's press."
"His helmet seals over his face, supplies an hour of air a day and can turn invisible."
"He trains the axe for a month under Yoro the axemaster in a town beneath an ocean."
"He is the third human to reach grade D and gains the technique Total Body Awareness."
"He takes the Rare class Magma Warrior, and his irises turn the color of fire."
"Team Earth calls him Devin the Crimson."
"Ella gives his axe a brass frame that holds a sliver of the Guardian's weapon core."
"His Concept is Earthblood, a lava-like magic of fire and earth."
"He leads the party that wins the Simulation Dome for Aurora."
"The brass frame on his axe grows into the Unique artifact Fang of the Lava Lord."
"He reaches level 50 and unlocks Epic classes."
